			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Jack"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 200630601,
					"content": "\"The monster was burning fiercely as its amorphous body wriggled slowly towards me... I fought and I screamed, but it didn't seem to do anything; the monster just looked at me contemptuously with those eyes... those terrifying eyes...\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630602,
					"content": "That's how Stanley described the monster. He also said that he only managed to defeat it because eventually — and this took every last ounce of his strength, apparently — he extinguished the flames on its body.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630603,
					"content": "But every time I ask him how, he refuses to elaborate. I wonder what tricks Stanley is hiding up his sleeve...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2006308,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2006304",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2006304,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_VAR_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"0",
							"2",
							"20063"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Jack"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 200630801,
					"content": "\"That huge shield was like something out of a nightmare, no matter how hard my sword struck it, it just wouldn't budge... Meanwhile, the monster sneered at me from behind the shield, glaring contemptuously with those eyes... those terrifying eyes...\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630802,
					"content": "That's what Cyrus told me. I remember it very specifically.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630803,
					"content": "He also told me that the key to defeating this monster was focusing on the shield first and finding a clever way to quickly destroy it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630804,
					"content": "Otherwise, once he lifts his shield up there's just no way to get a hit on him. No matter how good your swordsmanship is.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630805,
					"content": "Finally, Cyrus said, this monster waits for the perfect opportunity to strike. As soon as you let your guard down, even for a split second, it unleashes its ferocious attack.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630806,
					"content": "The ability to take down a monster like that is what makes Cyrus a true giant among Adventurers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200630807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200630807,
					"content": "*sigh* I don't think I could ever hope to reach that level...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2006310,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2006306",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2006306,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_VAR_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"0",
							"3",
							"20063"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Jack"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 200631001,
					"content": "\"There were ominous-looking ice crystals on the monster's body, as if to make it look larger, more intimidating... My legs froze with fear as I frantically flailed my weapon around... I dislodged a few shards of ice; brilliant, shining ice... Somehow I was transfixed by that ice...\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631002,
					"content": "I think that's the gist of what Stanley told me. As I say, though, he was totally hammered by that point and what I actually got was the word salad version. Ironically, although he continued the story after sobering up, that's the part I don't remember so well...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631003,
					"content": "In principle, of course, you'd tackle a Cryo monster with Pyro.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631004,
					"content": "But that's easier said than done. Quite how much Pyro you would need to repel Cryo power of that magnitude is beyond me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2006312,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2006308
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2006308",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2006308,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_VAR_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"0",
							"1",
							"20063"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Jack"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 200631201,
					"content": "Jack, hear me out... It's not like that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Stanley"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631202,
					"content": "But... Ah, you're back! How was it? Did you find the monster?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631203,
					"content": "Yes, although...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200631204,
					"content": "A Pyro Slime... Is that it? Impossible. That's not how Stanley described it at all!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631205,
					"content": "Good thing the man himself is right here! Go on Stanley, tell them about that adventure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631206,
					"content": "You know, the monster who burned fiercely...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631207,
					"content": "Oh, uh... that one, yeah, yeah... I was, uh, really drunk that day and... you know, I just don't remember it so clearly—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Stanley"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631208,
					"content": "Not a problem my good friend! I remember everything you told me — look, I have it written down here, word for word.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631209,
					"content": "Wow... But hey Jack, I just remembered this other story I totally forgot to tell you about before! It's from way, way back when I was...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Stanley"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2006313,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2006309
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2006309",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2006309,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_VAR_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"0",
							"2",
							"20063"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Jack"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 200631301,
					"content": "Jack, I'm telling you, adventuring is something you need to go out and do for yourself...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyrus"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631302,
					"content": "I appreciate that, but... Oh, you're back! How was it? Found the monster?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631303,
					"content": "Yup.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200631304,
					"content": "Amazing! What was it? ...Sorry? Did you just say a hilichurl? With a regular wooden shield?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631305,
					"content": "No way, that's just not possible. Cyrus must have been talking about something else... Are you sure you went to the right place?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631306,
					"content": "Good thing Cyrus is right here so he can clear it up. Cyrus, what do you make of this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631307,
					"content": "Hmm... Er... Yes, you're absolutely right Jack, certainly not the same monster that I encountered.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cyrus"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631308,
					"content": "...Why is Cyrus winking at us like his life depends on it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631309,
					"content": "Hahaha... Well I never. In a way it's a good thing — if such terrifying monsters were that easy to find, I'd never dare set foot outside the city!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631310,
					"content": "Thank you for your efforts. I must be going now, I have business to attend to.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Stanley"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2006314,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2006308
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"2006308",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 2006308,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_QUEST_VAR_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"0",
							"3",
							"20063"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Jack"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 200631401,
					"content": "Ugh... I think I've had too much to drink again, I've got a headache setting in and my memory's gone foggy...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Stanley"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631402,
					"content": "Not to worry — I sent someone out to investigate. Did you find the monster?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631403,
					"content": "Yes, but...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200631404,
					"content": "...Cryo Slime? Hmm. That doesn't seem to fit with the story Stanley told me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631405,
					"content": "You didn't go to the wrong place, did you? Hey Stanley, what's your take on this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631406,
					"content": "*cough* *cough* Guess what — I just remembered this other story I never told you. Jack, you'll definitely want to hear this one!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Stanley"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631407,
					"content": "But the Cryo Slime thing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200631408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jack"
				},
				{
					"id": 200631408,
					"content": "I guarantee you've never heard anything like this before. This one is from way, way, WAY back when I was...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Stanley"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2006316,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2006310
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
